@* A project's containers, a name a line, in a box as tall as a container
   card's own lines: the project's card is as tall as theirs however many it
   has, and the box scrolls, not the card. One that is not running is written
   fainter, one that failed in the error colour, with why in its tooltip.
   Drawn by the project's card in the Containers list and by its card on the
   dashboard. *@

<div class="wslc-card-members">
    @foreach (var member in Members)
    {
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="@(member.HasFailed ? "mud-error-text" : member.IsRunning ? "" : "mud-text-secondary")"
                 title="@($"{member.Name}: {(member.HasFailed ? member.Failure : member.State)}")">@member.Name</MudText>
    }
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public IReadOnlyList<ContainerSummary> Members { get; set; } = [];
}
